      "title": "Start with obligations and available resources",
      "narration": "Marcus and Elena return for a full family review. In this new exercise, their stated survivor income shortfall is thirty-five thousand dollars per year for fifteen years. Assume no inflation or investment return. That creates five hundred twenty-five thousand dollars of income need. They also identify two hundred thousand dollars of separate immediate obligations, with no overlap between the categories. The total is seven hundred twenty-five thousand dollars. They have one hundred twenty-five thousand dollars of resources explicitly available for these needs. Subtracting those resources leaves a six hundred thousand dollar illustrative gap. This is not a quote or a personal recommendation.",
